      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bottega Veneta has just unveiled its new bags for the Winter 2026 collection, and this season's pieces take their cue from the elegantly dressed Milanese in winter. Bags are reimagined as books, newspapers, miniature suitcases and other narrative-driven shapes, or accented with sequins, marble, little gold spheres and shearling, capturing the unique tension of Milan — a city where ruggedness and sensuality coexist.",
