    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Inspired by a book, the Opera clutch features a cardinal-red Intrecciato-woven sheep leather \"book cover\" paired with a cord-style leather wrist strap, while a gold-stamped motif lends the piece a classical air. At 21.5x16x4.5cm, the body holds a smartphone, lipstick, card case and other small essentials — a playful design that turns the bag into a witty, story-rich work of art.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
