      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Cubo evening bag is crafted from precious short-textured crocodile leather into a compact little box silhouette, with a metal frame, handle and square clasp that echo the sculptural form of the bag. Inside, a lambskin lining and a mirror make it feel like a treasure chest with a secret.",
