      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The La Milanese evening bag pairs a caramel crocodile leather body with a marble clasp, while the vintage kiss-lock closure lends an air of elegance and luxury. The new Sardine and Tosca bags are finished with a Sardine handle and spherical clasp in Diaspro Dalmata — a jasper with natural speckled veining — bringing the organic charm of natural stone to each piece.",
