    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Knot evening bag is entirely covered in gold sequins in a scrolling vine pattern, paired with a gold sheep leather lining and a silver-tone metal knot clasp for a shimmering, light-catching finish. The 1998 top-handle bag is embroidered all over with black sequins, as if dressed in a lavish evening gown. The Andiamo bag is adorned with precisely cut round leather sequins that evoke mermaid scales, extending the house's leather craftsmanship into a richly layered expression of texture.",
