      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Spicchio bag features a minimalist semicircular silhouette with a curved handle and leather wrist strap, while an adjustable shoulder strap allows for hand-carry, shoulder and crossbody wear. Little gold spheres at either side add a sculptural detail. Available in a small linen shade and a medium olive green, the body and side panels alternate between solid leather and Intrecciato-woven leather textures — a clean-lined structure with plenty of visual punch.",
